    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etamanya Isaak Gera",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyaaka olameyu ajing enkop leme olapa ameyu le nkata e Abraham. Nelo Isaak Gera enetii Abimelek olaiguanani loo Lfilisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neipang'aki Olaitoriani ninye ejoki, “Midoyio alo Misiri, totona tamanya enkop naaliki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.22.16+GEN.22.17+GEN.22.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 22.16-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Indurrudurra tena kop, naa kaaku nanu tenebo iyie, naa kaamayian, amu iyie tenebo iishoritin inono aisho kuna kuapi pooki, naitabaya olmumai lainosie papaai lino Abraham. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaponaa eishoi ino metotiwuo anaa ilakir le nkeper, naisho eishoi ino ena kop pooki naa te ishoi ino emayian iloshon le nkop pooki ate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore amu etoning'o Abraham oltoilo lai, neibung enkikoo ai, o nkitanapat aainei pooki.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku etamanya apa Isaak Gera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.12.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 12.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.20.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "20.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore peyie eikilikuan ilewa leine imbaa naipirta enkitok enye, etejo ninye “Enkanashe ai ninye.” Amu eturia ninye ejo, “Enkitok ai” edamu ajo, “keidim ilewa leine ataar ninye metua tenkaraki Rebeka,” amu aisidai ninye oleng te nidol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore peyie ebik ninye teine enkata naado eturumishe te lusie Abimelek olaiguanani loo Lfilisti, nedol Isaak eirrapirap Rebeka enkitok enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa eipoto Abimelek Isaak nejoki, “Nyorriki ime enkitok ino, kaji inkuna peyie itejo ‘Enkanashe ai ninye’?” Nejoki Isaak ninye, “Amu atadamua ajo, ‘peyie maye tenkaraki ninye,’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Abimelek, “Ainyoo ena nintaasa iyiook? Eidim obo loo ltung'ana ashomo enetii enkitok ino, nipik iyiook entaboi te sunkureisho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa eikoo Abimelek iltung'ana pooki ejoki, “Ore pooki ng'ae oiseyie ele tung'ani anaa enkitok enye naa keari metua.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neunisho Isaak teina kop ilo ari, netum enkisampuare iip nabore. Nemayian Olaitoriani ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku apa ilo tung'ani karsis neponari imasaa oleng oleng, ometaa tetia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eeta apa ntare kumok o luaat oo nkishu, olmarei sapuk ometaa etoduakita Ilfilisti olom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenuk Ilfilisti nchorroi pooki te nterit apa naatuturo ilaisiaayiak le menye aa Abraham. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Abimelek Isaak, “Shomo tung'uai iyiook, amu ira magilani aleng iyiook.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eidurra apa Isaak teine, nelo apik olng'obor lenye o erata le Gera nebik teine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Isaak atur nena shorroi oonkariak naatuturoki apa too nkolong'i e Papaai lenye, Abraham, amu etapalaitie Ilfilisti ninche peyie eye Abraham. Neisho sii inkarn apa naishoo menye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore peyie eidip ilaisiaayiak le Isaak aatuturisho te yarrata netum teine enchorro e nkare naijirrijirru, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neishankarrarre ilchekuti le Gera ilchekuti le Isaak ejoki, “Enaang ena are.” Neaku eipoto ina shorro enkare ajo Esek, amu eishankarrarre ninche ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ninche aatur ae shorro, neitoki ake aishankarrarre ninye teina aaigil neaku eipoto enkarna enye ajo Sitina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neidur teine atur ae shorro, neitu ejing enchankar ina, neaku eipoto enkarna eina Rehobot ejo, “Ore tena kata eitaikia iyiook Olaitoriani ewueji nelala, naa aikibul te nkop.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepuku teine ailep alo Beer-sheba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neipang'aki Olaitoriani ninye ina kewarie nejoki, “Ara nanu Enkai e Abraham papaai lino, miureishoyu amu atii tenebo iyie, naa kaamayian iyie naitubul eishoi ino tenkaraki osinka lai Abraham.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku etesheta olperere lo lasar teine neipot enkarna Olaitoriani, neun olng'obor lenye teine, Netur ilaisiaayiak le Isaak enchorro enkare teine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Olning'o terishata e Isaak o Abimelek",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
