            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.21.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 21.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neitoki adumunye Abimelek alo enetii ninye eing'uaa Gera tenebo Ahusa olautaroni lenye tenebo Fikol olkitok lenye le njore, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nejoki Isaak ninche, “Ainyoo peyie ietuo enatii nadolita ajo aikimbaba intae nanu, nikitaaraitie aitung'uaa ate?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo ninche, “Kidolita metii olng'ash aajo etii Olaitoriani tenebo iyie metaa kitejo, inchoo maitayu olmumai terishata ino o iyiook naa maitayu sii olning'o o iyie, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inchere mintaas iyiook intorrok anaa eneitu kiseyie iyie neitu kintaas iyie entorroni meteleku eseriani ake nikincho iyie shomo te seriani. Ira taata iyie olomayiana lo Laitoriani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa eitobiraka ninye ninche osirua, nedaa neokisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore peyie ekenyu, enyeito ninche enasirie aainos pooki olmumai, neisho Isaak ninche meshomo, nepuo aaing'uaa ninye to sotua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake teina olong eetuo ilaisiaayiak le Isaak aaliki ninye enchorro e nkare natuturo ejoki ninye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kinotito enkare.” Neisho enkarna ine aajo shiba, metaa ore enkarna eina anasa naa keji Beer-sheba o metabaiki ena olong.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Inkituaak e Esau naainguaa iloreren",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
